ot Stamping line for passenger-vehicle structural parts, subject to regulatory approvals; no investment figure disclosed (baseline's own content-mismatch flag retained).","**Lord's Mark Industries** — completes its Silvassa manufacturing expansion ahead of schedule and secures US FDA registration for 200+ surgical/hygiene products, exports to begin December; no investment figure in the release."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 97 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, per the baseline's own count, not itemised here.","**Jainik Power Cables** — invests in a new 54-wire high-speed rigid stranding machine; the company forecasts ~Rs 250 cr of additional annual revenue potential and up to Rs 1,000 cr cumulative capacity (the company's own forward estimate, not an investment figure or a transaction amount).","**LTM** — LTM Launches BlueVerse Industrial AI Lab in Chennai, helping enterprises scale AI across physical operations and intelligent products (filing text not in this pass's cache; carried from the baseline's own headline, unread).","**Aditya Birla Real Estate** — subsidiary Birla Estates launches a premium residential project in Hinjewadi, Pune, via a Joint Development Agreement spanning 5.62 acres (~1.25 mn sq ft saleable), with a company-stated revenue POTENTIAL of ~Rs 1,650 cr (a forecast, not a transaction value).","**Ramco Systems** — posts Q2 revenue of USD 19.20 mn, up 4% QoQ (filing text not in this pass's cache; carried from the baseline's own headline, unread)."],"distress_risk":["**Osia Hyper Retail** — convenes the 8th Committee of Creditors meeting under its ongoing CIRP."],"open_offers":["**Shaival Reality Limited** — TARANGKUMAR MANUBHAI SAVALIYA open offer for 72.63% (30.09 lakh shares) at Rs 30 vs CMP 33 (-9.1%); change of control (Reg 4) + >25% acquisition (Reg 3(1)); **DO NOT TENDER - market pays more than the offer**; tender window 